<view class="page"><view class="title">身材小档案</view><view class="muted">选填，用于搭配建议；本体验版暂不含摄像头扫描。单位请核对。</view><view class="card"><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key"><view>{{item.label}}</view><input class="field" type="digit" value="{{body[item.key]}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindinput="field" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">保存身材信息</button></view></view>
